        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">DN 300, profile 2 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Polymere concrete pipe, 300 mm, outer diameter 366 mm, wall thickness 33 mm, 79 kg/m, 2300 kg/m³\n\n# Included processes\nThis process models 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with cast iron pipe and a trench depth of 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3) and the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) for 1 meter of installed cast iron pipe, including trench excavation and backfilling. Disposal and deconstruction processes are excluded and modelled separately specific for each sewer system type. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
